<h1>Report Generation</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Reports &gt; Generate Report</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">in</span> <span class="Mode" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Inspection</u></span> <span lang="EN-US">mode or by pressing</span></i></b> <b><i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Button" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Generate Report</b></span></i></b><b><i style="font-style:normal;"><b><i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;">button</i></b></i></b><span lang="EN-US"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;">in the Inspection toolbar.</i></b></span></p>
<p class="description"><b><i style="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> The data collected during the inspection process can be saved in a report file in HTML and/or <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal;"><b>PDF</b></span> format using the Report function. Click the Report button on the Inspection toolbar and you will see the Generate Report dialog.</i></b></p>
<p><img src="../images/report_generation.gif" width="531px" height="451px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="sub-head">Template section</p>
<p><span lang="EN-US">You can create your own templates for reports, that will save you some time, next time you make a report. Fill in the fields in the next section and click</span> <b><span class="Button">Save as</span> button. Then in the dialog that will appear type the name for the template. In order to delete a template, select it from the list and click</b> <b style="font-weight:normal;"><span class="Button">Delete</span></b> <span lang="EN-GB">button.</span></p>
<p class="sub-head">Report tree</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b><i style="font-style:normal;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">General</span></b></i></b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Title</span></b> <span lang="EN-US">- the title of the report</span></i></b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Author</span></b> <span lang="EN-US">- the person who made the report</span></i></b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Company</span></b> <span lang="EN-US">- the company of the author</span></i></b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Client</span></b> <span lang="EN-US">- the client, who required the report</span></i></b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Reference</b></span> - additional text from the author</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Date of measurement</span></b> <span lang="EN-US">- the date when the inspection was made</span></i></b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Date of report</span></b> <span lang="EN-US">- the date when the report is generated (in this field current date is auto-inserted)</span></i></b></p>
<p class="Example" style="font-weight:normal; text-decoration:underline;"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></i></b></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP162312637" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../images/report_generation_2.gif" width="531px" height="451px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="parameterstitle" style="font-weight:normal;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Introduction</b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US">Write a short introduction to the current report.</span></i></b></p>
<p class="Example" style="font-weight:normal; text-decoration:underline;"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></i></b></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP164710442" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../images/report_generation_3.gif" width="531px" height="451px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Conclusion</b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;">H</span><span lang="EN-US">ere you may write a short conclusion regarding the suitability of the scanned surface. The Conclusion field is similar to the field Introduction.</span></i></b></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Header &amp; Footer</b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US">Define your own header and footer for the generated report.</span></i></b></p>
<p class="Example" style="font-weight:normal; text-decoration:underline;"><b><i style="font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color:#000000; font-weight:normal;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a4" style="text-decoration:underline;"><font color="black">Example</font></a></span></i></b></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP222961438" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../images/report_generation_5.gif" width="531px" height="451px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Company Logo</b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US">You can place your company logo on the report</span></i></b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b><i style="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;"><span class="Button" style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><b>Attach/Detach button</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">-</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:normal;">click</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><b>Attach</b></span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:normal;">button to locate and add an image (BMP, JPG or GIF format) to the report pages. If already added you could remove the image from the report pages by using</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><b>Detach</b></span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:normal;">button.</span></i></b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Merge logo with information table</span></b> <span lang="EN-US"> If this option is checked, the company logo will be included as first or last column of the information table in each report page. This checkbox can be enabled for Left and Right alignment only, otherwise it is grayed.</span></i></b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><i style="font-style:normal;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Logo Alignment</span></b> section -</i> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:normal;">specify where the logo should be placed - Left, Centre or Right.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="font-weight:normal; text-decoration:underline;"><b><i style="font-style:italic;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color:#000000; font-weight:normal;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a5" style="text-decoration:underline;"><font color="black">Example</font></a></span></i></b></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP288738654" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p class="whs5"><i style="font-style:normal;"><b><span lang="EN-US"><img src="../images/gen_report.gif" width="531px" height="451px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></span></b></i></p>
</div>
<p class="parameterstitle"><i style="font-style:normal;"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>P</b></span>ages</b></i></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">You can define in this section which report pages to include in the report. The General page is included as header page by default. The rest of the pages should be selected and added by the user.</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US">Use the left/right arrow buttons to add or remove pages to the report.</span></i></b></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US">Use the up/down arrow buttons to rearrange the pages sequence in the report.</span></i></b></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><b><i style="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-US">Use</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Add all &gt;&gt;</b></span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:normal;">button to include all existing pages in the report.</span></i></b></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><b><i style="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-US">Use</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>&lt;&lt; Clear all</b></span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:normal;">button to remove all pages from the repor</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:italic;"><i>t.</i></span></i></b></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example" style="font-weight:normal; text-decoration:underline;"><b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a3" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></i></b></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP224869837" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../images/report_generation_4.gif" width="531px" height="451px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="parameterstitle"><i style="font-style:normal;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB">File Format</span></b></i></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><i style="font-style:normal;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">Choose the format for the output file. You can save your reports in HTML or PDF format.</span> </b></i></p>
<p id="P2" class="parameterdescription"><b><i style="font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-style:normal;">In</span></i></b> <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>PDF</b></span> reports for all pages having labels (exception is the Header page) are included additional pages containing tables with label information: <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Point XYZ</b></span>, <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Reference XYZ</b></span>, <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Distance Absolute/XYZ</b></span>, and <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Pass/Fail</b></span> criteria for each label despite its formatting. Labels with PASS are printed in black, while labels with FAIL are printed in red colour.</p>
<p class="Example" id="P2" style="font-weight:normal; text-decoration:underline;"><b><i style="font-style:italic;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color:#000000; font-weight:normal;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a6" style="text-decoration:underline;"><font color="black">Example</font></a></span></i></b></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP221071466" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p class="whs5"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b><img src="../images/labels_pdf.gif" width="549px" height="710px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></b></span></p>
</div>
<p class="Warning" id="P2"><i style="font-style:italic;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">In order to have PDF output active, you need to install the pdf995 printer, included in the product package.</b></i></p>
<p class="Important" id="P2"><b><i style="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="javascript:void(0);" onclick="var e; if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion)&gt;=4){e=event;} if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) &gt;=2 &amp;&amp; typeof(PopupMenu_Invoke) == 'function') PopupMenu_Invoke(e,'','Custom Report Generation','Custom_Report_Generation.htm','More Info','More_Info.htm','Plot Window','Plot_Window.htm');return false;" title=""><img src="../images/ss_btn_see_also.gif" border="0" height="17" width="60" alt=""></a></span></i></b></p>

